OL,3,AMet hands Grenfell fire investigation
OL,4,Afile to CPS
OL,5,
OL,6,FRoyal Borough of Kensington and Chelsea
OL,7,F(RBKC) and the Department of Housing
OL,8,Fhave both been referred to the CPS
OL,9,Ffollowing the fire which killed 72
OL,10,Fpeople at the tower block in North
OL,11,FKensington, west London.
OL,13,FThe CPS said charging decisions would
OL,14,Fbe made before the 10th anniversary of
OL,15,Fthe disaster, which is on 14 June 2027.
OL,23,APub: 30-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
